NOTE ON DATASETS AND PRETRAINED WEIGHTS

This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does not
extend to third-party datasets or pretrained model weights, each of which
carries its own terms:

  - FER-2013            (Kaggle competition terms)
  - TESS                (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — non-commercial)
  - RAVDESS             (CC BY-NA-SC 4.0 — non-commercial)
  - CREMA-D             (Open Database License)
  - SAVEE               (research use, registration required)
  - MELD                (GPL-3.0)
  - GloVe               (Public Domain Dedication and License)
  - DeBERTa / WavLM     (MIT, Microsoft)

Several of these are non-commercial. Any model trained on them inherits that
restriction. See docs/datasets.md for provenance and per-dataset terms.

Code under legacy/v1/ includes work adapted from a third-party repository
(MITESHPUTHRANNEU/Speech-Emotion-Analyzer); it is retained for audit and
provenance purposes and is documented as such in legacy/v1/README.md.
